* {{l|oj|nakawe||a Saulteaux/Eastern Ojibwe}}
* {{l|oj|odaawaa||an Odawa}}
* {{l|oj|odishkwaagamii||an Algonquin}}
* {{l|oj|ojibwe||an Ojibwe}}

