===Adverb===
{{head|oj|adverb|cat2=negative adverbs}}

# do [[not]], [[don't]]
#: {{ux|oj|'''Gego''' imaa izhaaken.|'''Don't''' go there.}}

====Usage notes====
'''Gego''' introduces prohibitive (negative) imperative commands or requests. The verb which follows also contains a prohibitive suffix.

====Derived terms====
{{col|oj
|gego bina<t:just don't>
|gego ganage<t:don't in any way>
|gego gwech<t:not much>
|gego mashi<t:don't ... yet>
|gego memwech<t:you don't have to>
|gego wiikaa<t:don't ever>
}}

====See also====
* {{l|oj|gaawiin|t=no, not}}
* {{l|oj|maanoo|t=don't care, never mind}}

===References===
* The Ojibwe People's Dictionary https://ojibwe.lib.umn.edu/main-entry/gego-adv-neg

-------- end text --------
