Page 798 miigisapikan: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
* [[miigis]]
* [[apikan]] (''ni'')

===Noun===
{{oj-noun|l|ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑲᓐ}}

# [[wampum belt]]

====Declension====
* plural: '''[[miigisapikanan]]''' ('''[[ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑲᓇᓐ]]''')
* diminutive: '''[[miigisapikaans]]''' ('''[[ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑳᓐᐦᔅ]]''')
* contemptive: '''[[miigisapikaanh]]''' ('''[[ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑳᔾ]]''')

Other Syllabic forms:
* Fully pointed mixed-finals: '''ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑲᓐ'''
* Fully-pointed Eastern A-finals: '''ᒦᑭᐦᓴᐦᐱᐦᑲᓐ'''
* Common Eastern A-finals: '''ᒦᑭᓴᐱᑲᓐ'''
* Unpointed Eastern A-finals: '''ᒥᑭᓴᐱᑲᓐ'''

Transformations
* unaffected: '''miigisapikan'''
* syncope: '''miigsapkan'''
* initial change: '''maagisapikan'''
* initial change syncope: '''maagsapkan'''
* reduplication: '''maamiigisapikan'''
* reduplication syncope: '''maamiigsapkan'''
* initial change reduplication: '''mayaagisapikan'''
* initial change reduplication syncope: '''myaagispikan'''

Other Roman orthographies
* Algonquin: '''mìgisapikan'''
** Cuoq: '''migisapikan'''
* Manitoba Saulteaux: '''mīkihsahpihkan'''
** Ontario Saulteaux: '''miikihsahpihkan'''
* Baraga: '''migissâpikan'''

===References===
* {{R:Freelang}}
* {{R:Baraga 1878}}: B0234
* {{R:Cuoq 1886}}
* {{R:Nichols Ojibwe}}
* {{R:Rhodes Ojibwa}}

