Page 826 na: -------- begin text --------

===Particle===
{{head|oj|particles}}

# Question marker for yes/no questions. It is always placed after the first word in the sentence. If the first word ends in a vowel, use the particle '''na'''; if it ends in a consonant, use [[ina#Ojibwe|ina]].
#* [[minikwe|Giminikwe]] '''na'''? — ''Are you drinking?''
#* Gigii-[[anokii]] '''na''' [[bijiinaago]]? — ''Did you work yesterday?''
#* but: [[wiisini|Giwiisin]] [[ina#Ojibwe|ina]]? — ''Are you eating?''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|oj|ina}}

