===Etymology===
{{inh+|oj|alg-pro|*ni·ra}}. Cognate to {{cog|otw|-}}/{{cog|ojg|niin}}, {{cog|pot|nin}}, {{cog|pim|near}}, {{cog|crk|nîya}}.

===Pronunciation===
