# {{ng|[[nominalizing]] final}}
## {{ng|concept-noun-forming final}} {{gloss|-ing, -tion, -ment}}
##: {{suffixusex|oj|anishinaabemo|t1=S/he speaks the [[Anishinaabe]] language|anishinaabemowin|t2=the Anishinaabe language}}
##: {{suffixusex|oj|ikwewi|t1=She is a woman|ikwewiwin|t2=womanhood}}
