* {{l|oj|ᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴᒌᐱᐦᒃ}} ([[zhiishiigwejiibik]])
* {{l|oj|ᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴᐗᐦᔮᓐ}} ([[zhiishiigwewayaan]])
* {{l|oj|ᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴᓐᐦᔅ}} ([[zhiishiigwens]])

; Transformations
* Unaffected: ᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴ (''zhiishiigwe'')
* Initial change: ᔖᐦᔒᐝᑴ (''zhaashiigwe'')
* Reduplication: ᔖᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴ (''zhaazhiishiigwe'')
* Initial change reduplication: ᔕᐦᔮᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴ (''zhayaazhiishiigwe'')
** Initial change reduplication with syncope: ᔥᐦᔮᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴ (''zhyaazhiishiigwe'')

; Other Syllabic forms
* Fully pointed mixed-finals: ᔒᐦᔒᐝᑴ
* Fully-pointed Eastern A-finals: ᔒᐦᔒᑴ
* Common Eastern A-finals: ᔒᔒᑴ
* Unpointed Eastern A-finals: ᔑᔑᑴ

